{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 825, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f8b2f18ef8f4f0ecf0b2f0a8f1c72f2ff0a4f957f1ccf8f3f1b5f29ef0a4f1d481432f2ff1c5f36cfa57f14af957f1b5f29ef0a9f7d1", "baseline_text": "이 정도 적이라면//지는 일은 없겠지만，//방심할 수는 없겠군…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この程度の敵なら//負けることはないだろうが、//油断はできないな……", "pointer_offset": 720, "unit": "dialogue:4d8f62b1bf2427b1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 892, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f15af0b2f15af0b28143f0b5f0b5f144f0abf7d12f2ff0d8f27ef8f1f141f0e4f0a5f1c781432f2ff0b5f0b6f9b2f8dff24df36df8b2f991f0b1f260f0cff1848144", "baseline_text": "어이어이，오오가미…//그렇게 긴장하면，//오히려 제 실력이 안 나온다고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おいおい大神……//そんなに緊張してると、//逆に調子がでねぇってもんだぜ。", "pointer_offset": 724, "unit": "dialogue:d4c1e79705fa5765", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 965, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f144f4f6f0f381432f2ff14ff9cef1f7f8cbf379f0af2f2ff1bdf9c9f1acf957f8f1f15af16e8148", "baseline_text": "가끔은，//기분 전환 삼아//싸워 보는 게 어때？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "たまには、//気分を変えて//戦ってみたらどうだ？", "pointer_offset": 728, "unit": "dialogue:29ec641ab9423687", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1012, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f14f8143f14ff9cef263f149f0b8f26181ac2f2ff0bbf3acf0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "기，기분 말입니까〓//글쎄요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "き、気分ですか〓//そうですね……", "pointer_offset": 732, "unit": "dialogue:0c1de91963997396", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1045, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f26af485f9a9f14ff1cef0a2f8a3f144f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "상쾌한 기분으로 가자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さわやか気分でいこう！", "pointer_offset": 736, "unit": "dialogue:baad394b58ea369f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1068, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0adf2c3f8c8f0cff2b2f984f0b1f0aff144f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "마음을 다잡고 나아가자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "気を引きしめていこう！", "pointer_offset": 740, "unit": "dialogue:8ce4c9a67c08f7ff", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1729, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f142f485f9a9f1cef279f14ff8a3f144f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "유쾌한 분위기로 가자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お笑いムードでいこう！", "pointer_offset": 744, "unit": "dialogue:3bc1eeb9827c4afd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1114, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a4f7d12f2ff26af485f9a9f14ff1cef0a2f0a32f2ff1bdf9c9f1acf14ff8a3f257f2618144", "baseline_text": "그렇지…//상쾌한 기분으로//싸워 보기로 할까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうだな……//さわやかな気分で//戦ってみることにするか。", "pointer_offset": 748, "unit": "dialogue:c596b17ecdcf3c75", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1171, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "5f62676d6361686e6765", "baseline_text": "_bgmcahnge", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_bgmcahnge", "pointer_offset": 752, "unit": "dialogue:d5c98d124c6f1d2f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1756, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f7d12f2ff0a4f17bf1acf8cffab8f18ef0dbf8c8f1abfbe7f2bdf0aef1842f2ff1bdf1adf8a4f287f0a2f9c7f279f39ef14b81b8", "baseline_text": "아니…//지금보다 더 정신을 바짝 차리고//싸우지 않으면 위험해∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや……//今よりも、気を引きしめて//戦わないと危険だ！", "pointer_offset": 756, "unit": "dialogue:d9231daaeb8fea50", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1237, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "5f62676d6361686e6765", "baseline_text": "_bgmcahnge", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_bgmcahnge", "pointer_offset": 760, "unit": "dialogue:d5c98d124c6f1d2f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1248, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f1cff0aff7d12f2ff142f485f9a9f1cef279f14ff0a381432f2ff0ecf8c8f1c5f36cf0a5f8f1f1d4f1daf2618144", "baseline_text": "좋아…//유쾌한 분위기로，//적을 방심하게 만들까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし……//お笑いムードで、//敵を油断させるか。", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:a8b4b7672f94c4a4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1295, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "5f62676d6361686e6765", "baseline_text": "_bgmcahnge", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_bgmcahnge", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:d5c98d124c6f1d2f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1306, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1315, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f0eff0f0f8cff0a6f240f17cf8e1f263f277f0e2f0a381432f2ff14ff1cef8c8f1f7f0cbf0a5f957f299f0f42f2ff1cff0c8f0a4f8f4f271f272f29ef0a4f1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "요네다 사령관의 말씀대로，//기분을 전환하는 것도//좋을지도 모르겠지만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "米田司令の言うとおり、//気分を変えるのも//いいかもしれないけど……", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:b51ad60dc32df786", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1382, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "5f62676d6361686e6765", "baseline_text": "_bgmcahnge", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_bgmcahnge", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:d5c98d124c6f1d2f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1393, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f2b4f0bc8143f0a4f17bf8f3f8b2f14ff1cef0a2f0a32f2ff1bdf1adf14ff8a3f0a5f0faf7d1", "baseline_text": "역시，지금은 이 기분으로//싸우기로 하자…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "やっぱり、//今は、この気分で//戦うことにしよう……", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:bd3febd10e3c5a29", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1444, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa62f0bdf3d1f0d3f144f7d1", "baseline_text": "이런 느낌인가…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こんな感じか……", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:6ee24dfd9aee0e3f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1461, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f8b2f14ff1cef0a2f0a38143f144f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "이 기분으로，가자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この気分で、いこう！", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:19b0c8ec838490cb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1482, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f29ff2a08143fa64f0cff368f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "잠깐，좀 다른데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと、ちがうな……", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:f9422fff9b371cb8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1505, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f8b2f14ff1cef0a2f8a3f144f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "좋아，이 기분으로 가자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、この気分でいこう！", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:f8ee18b86aa8d4b3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1530, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0eff0f0f8cff0a6f240f17cf8e1f263f277f0e2f0a381432f2ff144f4f6f0f38143f14ff9cef1f7f0cbf8c8f94bf1acf957f299f0f42f2ff1cff29ef0a9f7d1", "baseline_text": "요네다 사령관의 말씀대로，//가끔은，기분 전환을 해 보는 것도//좋겠군…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "米田司令の言うとおり、//たまには、気分を変えてみるのも//いいものだな……", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:5fa4c97323576033", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1603, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f29ff2a08143f25af96bf0cffb68f0bdf3d1f0b2f0a9f7d12f2ff0cff8bcf9a9f2488143f0c6f0f7f94bf366f2618144", "baseline_text": "잠깐，너무 다른 느낌이군…//다시 한 번，생각해 볼까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと、ちがいすぎたな……//もう一度、考えてみるか。", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:a6fa079f88676642", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1658, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f29ff2a08143f0bdf3d1f8b2fa64f0cff368f18df7d12f2ff0cff8bcf9a9f2488143f0c6f0f7f94bf366f2618144", "baseline_text": "잠깐，느낌이 좀 다른데…//다시 한 번，생각해 볼까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと、ちがう感じだな……//もう一度、考えてみるか。", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:337635349b90454b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1713, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02024.SBN", "offset": 1718, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "5f62676d6361686e6765", "baseline_text": "_bgmcahnge", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_bgmcahnge", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:d5c98d124c6f1d2f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
